Spec: Android read-only Binder entry

Purpose:
  Capture real Binder caller context before invoking bounded portable negotiation.

Owns:
  ./ControlService.java

Must:
  Capture calling UID and user handle synchronously on the Binder thread and reject other user profiles.
  Reject null or over-limit inputs before package inspection and never trust caller identity supplied in JSON.
  Acquire a nonblocking per-UID/global lease before identity resolution and release it on every exit.
  Return fixed Binder errors for malformed input, unavailable identity or quota exhaustion without reflection or logs.
  Accept only the explicit binding action and disable started-service use.
  In pending builds, pass the actual identity snapshot to the pending handler and initialize private storage lazily.
  Return unsupported for appended formal descriptor transactions without changing existing pending behavior.
